{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"2CO","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"哥林多后书","commonName":"哥林多后书","title":"哥林多后书","order":47,"numberOfChapters":13,"sha256":"72b1061cc86dce53418169bc52aa5129601cef464e3676ce67f900ee20efdee1","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/2CO/1.json","lastChapterNumber":13,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/2CO/13.json","totalNumberOfVerses":257},"chapter":{"number":6,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["我们与 神同工的，也劝你们不可徒受他的恩典。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["因为他说：「在悦纳的时候，我应允了你；在拯救的日子，我搭救了你。」看哪，现在正是悦纳的时候！现在正是拯救的日子；"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["我们凡事都不叫人有妨碍，免得这职分被人毁谤；"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["反倒在各样的事上表明自己是 神的用人，就如在许多的忍耐、患难、穷乏、困苦、"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["鞭打、监禁、扰乱、勤劳、警醒、不食、"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["廉洁、知识、恒忍、恩慈、圣灵的感化、无伪的爱心、"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["真实的道理、 神的大能；仁义的兵器在左在右；"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["荣耀、羞辱，恶名、美名；似乎是诱惑人的，却是诚实的；"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["似乎不为人所知，却是人所共知的；似乎要死，却是活着的；似乎受责罚，却是不至丧命的；"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["似乎忧愁，却是常常快乐的；似乎贫穷，却是叫许多人富足的；似乎一无所有，却是样样都有的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["哥林多人哪，我们向你们，口是张开的，心是宽宏的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["你们狭窄，原不在乎我们，是在乎自己的心肠狭窄。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["你们也要照样用宽宏的心报答我。我这话正像对自己的孩子说的。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["永生 神的殿"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["你们和不信的原不相配，不要同负一轭。义和不义有什么相交呢？光明和黑暗有什么相通呢？"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["基督和彼列",{"noteId":6},"有什么相和呢？信主的和不信主的有什么相干呢？"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["神的殿和偶像有什么相同呢？因为我们是永生 神的殿，就如 神曾说：",{"text":"我要在他们中间居住，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在他们中间来往；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要作他们的 神；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们要作我的子民。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又说：你们务要从他们中间出来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"与他们分别；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要沾不洁净的物，我就收纳你们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要作你们的父；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要作我的儿女。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是全能的主说的。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":6,"caller":"-","text":"彼列就是撒但的别名","reference":{"chapter":6,"verse":15}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/2CO/6.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/2CO/7.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/2CO/5.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":18}